For attribution, credit computer-science-learning-agent contributors and link
to https://github.com/nguyenan97/computer-science-learning-agent. Identify changes
and retain existing source citations.

Third-party code, quotations and assets keep their own licenses and attribution.
In particular vendor/ retains its upstream license files. These project grants
cover only rights held by project contributors: they do not relicense cited
papers, IUH source documents or historical syllabus extracts in earlier commits.
Course names/codes and source references identify the self-study map; they are
not a grant to redistribute the underlying institutional documents.
